WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.433
"That T. rex is big," Sara said.

2
00:00:07.434 --> 00:00:10.427
"But I have a plan."

3
00:00:10.428 --> 00:00:14.538
"What is it?" Rex asked.

4
00:00:14.538 --> 00:00:19.534
Sara whispered to her friends.

5
00:00:19.535 --> 00:00:24.153
"Roar!" The T. rex stomped.

6
00:00:24.154 --> 00:00:27.492
Lizards and squirrels ran.

7
00:00:27.493 --> 00:00:30.978
Sara blocked the T. rex.

8
00:00:30.979 --> 00:00:34.486
The T. rex laughed.

9
00:00:34.487 --> 00:00:36.575
"You're small.

10
00:00:36.576 --> 00:00:41.178
You can't stop me!"

11
00:00:41.179 --> 00:00:46.154
Sara shrugged. "Maybe not.

12
00:00:46.155 --> 00:00:52.912
But my big friend can!"

13
00:00:52.913 --> 00:00:56.251
The T. rex looked around.

14
00:00:56.252 --> 00:01:01.215
"Where is your friend?"

15
00:01:01.216 --> 00:01:04.358
Suddenly trees shook.

16
00:01:04.359 --> 00:01:08.498
"Roar! Roar!"

17
00:01:08.499 --> 00:01:12.450
Wham! Slam! Bam!

18
00:01:12.451 --> 00:01:14.433
Sara smiled.

19
00:01:14.434 --> 00:01:19.585
"That's my friend," she said.

20
00:01:19.586 --> 00:01:22.349
"He's much bigger than you are!"

21
00:01:22.350 --> 00:01:32.733
The T. rex gulped.

22
00:01:32.734 --> 00:01:35.458
He ran away.

23
00:01:35.459 --> 00:01:40.505
Sara giggled.

24
00:01:40.506 --> 00:01:44.237
The trees stopped shaking.

25
00:01:44.238 --> 00:01:47.050
It was quiet now.

26
00:01:47.051 --> 00:01:51.219
Tor peeked out from the branches.

27
00:01:51.220 --> 00:01:55.338
Sid and Rex ran over.

28
00:01:55.339 --> 00:01:59.410
"We scared the big T. rex!" Sid said.

29
00:01:59.411 --> 00:02:02.975
His tail smacked the ground. Wham!

30
00:02:02.976 --> 00:02:10.889
Sara laughed. "We don't need to be big.

31
00:02:10.890 --> 00:02:19.008
We just need to be clever!"

